    "detailed_description": "<strong>Dynamic roguelike shooter!</strong> <br>Shattered Between is a combination of an FPS and a roguelike. Travel through the rooms, clearing them of enemies, collect weapons and upgrades, get to the final boss!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/70ae11285fe0c89675649b5902a19c45.poster.avif?t=1705773177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/70ae11285fe0c89675649b5902a19c45.webm?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/70ae11285fe0c89675649b5902a19c45.mp4?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Augmentations, not boring characters!</strong> <br>At the beginning of the game, you choose an augmentation - the starting ability of the hero, which you will further develop. Time dilation, universal gravity, and so on will all be available to you. Find a combination of augmentation and weapons that fit your style of play!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/92612485e4c155de1d2efd88330a9df9.poster.avif?t=1705773177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/92612485e4c155de1d2efd88330a9df9.webm?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/92612485e4c155de1d2efd88330a9df9.mp4?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Unique weapons!</strong> <br>There isn\u2019t a huge number of identical rifles. Instead, you're able to experience on your enemies a bending laser beam, a ball of glowing plasma, and even more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/2fbb0e11d776cb6fb5e55ccd553fbf0c.poster.avif?t=1705773177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/2fbb0e11d776cb6fb5e55ccd553fbf0c.webm?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/2fbb0e11d776cb6fb5e55ccd553fbf0c.mp4?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Travel between rooms-worlds!</strong> <br>In Shattered Between you don\u2019t walk through a monotonous dungeon because each room here is its own separate world. Get ready to explore a variety of locations and confront the dangers<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/648e206dce13e6ce9a5562f642507879.poster.avif?t=1705773177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/648e206dce13e6ce9a5562f642507879.webm?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/648e206dce13e6ce9a5562f642507879.mp4?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Dynamic roguelike shooter!</strong> <br>Shattered Between is a combination of an FPS and a roguelike. Travel through the rooms, clearing them of enemies, collect weapons and upgrades, get to the final boss!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/70ae11285fe0c89675649b5902a19c45.poster.avif?t=1705773177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/70ae11285fe0c89675649b5902a19c45.webm?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/70ae11285fe0c89675649b5902a19c45.mp4?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Augmentations, not boring characters!</strong> <br>At the beginning of the game, you choose an augmentation - the starting ability of the hero, which you will further develop. Time dilation, universal gravity, and so on will all be available to you. Find a combination of augmentation and weapons that fit your style of play!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/92612485e4c155de1d2efd88330a9df9.poster.avif?t=1705773177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/92612485e4c155de1d2efd88330a9df9.webm?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/92612485e4c155de1d2efd88330a9df9.mp4?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Unique weapons!</strong> <br>There isn\u2019t a huge number of identical rifles. Instead, you're able to experience on your enemies a bending laser beam, a ball of glowing plasma, and even more!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/2fbb0e11d776cb6fb5e55ccd553fbf0c.poster.avif?t=1705773177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/2fbb0e11d776cb6fb5e55ccd553fbf0c.webm?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/2fbb0e11d776cb6fb5e55ccd553fbf0c.mp4?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Travel between rooms-worlds!</strong> <br>In Shattered Between you don\u2019t walk through a monotonous dungeon because each room here is its own separate world. Get ready to explore a variety of locations and confront the dangers<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/648e206dce13e6ce9a5562f642507879.poster.avif?t=1705773177\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/648e206dce13e6ce9a5562f642507879.webm?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906470/extras/648e206dce13e6ce9a5562f642507879.mp4?t=1705773177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
